(6410071, 951010, 83313, '<td valign="top">First thing I noticed was the absence of graffiti. This certainly isn''t a subway in the USA!</td>', 'First thing I noticed was the absence of graffiti. This certainly isn''t a subway in the USA!', '2011-05-11 01:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
