(6410094, 950575, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this shot, but I find the composition to be very awkward, the way her elbows are cut off at the bottom of the frame, while I don''t find the bit of sky at the top adds anything to the scene. I''d suggest framing differently or zooming in a little closer so that her magnified eye in the scope is what the viewer is drawn to. Lot''s of great potential here, however. If you do a reshoot or re-edit, I''d love to see it.</td>', 'I like the idea of this shot, but I find the composition to be very awkward, the way her elbows are cut off at the bottom of the frame, while I don''t find the bit of sky at the top adds anything to the scene. I''d suggest framing differently or zooming in a little closer so that her magnified eye in the scope is what the viewer is drawn to. Lot''s of great potential here, however. If you do a reshoot or re-edit, I''d love to see it.', '2011-05-11 01:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
