(6410156, 950987, 83313, '<td valign="top">Almost comes off as a snapshot, and probably actually is a shot of opportunity. It works well, though. Sharp, nice light and pleasing colors. I''m quite liking this. The retro furniture is intriguing, and I like the story conveyed. Hope Fluffy enjoyed the beer. The only minor issue I would nitpick about is the target bag in the corner and I would have overlooked it had I not paused to leave this long winded comment.</td>', 'Almost comes off as a snapshot, and probably actually is a shot of opportunity. It works well, though. Sharp, nice light and pleasing colors. I''m quite liking this. The retro furniture is intriguing, and I like the story conveyed. Hope Fluffy enjoyed the beer. The only minor issue I would nitpick about is the target bag in the corner and I would have overlooked it had I not paused to leave this long winded comment.', '2011-05-11 01:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
