(6410575, 950044, 117534, '<td valign="top">I see you have been studying Gyban ... You did a pretty good job of this!! I''m sure you''ve problay got comments on this before but in case not, the lamp base is slightly askew and the cord loops up instead of hanging down.   I DO LOVE how you flipped the end of your hair so it looks like it''s hanging down in the air, Over all you paid a Lot of attention to detail, and I just really Like this!!</td>', 'I see you have been studying Gyban ... You did a pretty good job of this!! I''m sure you''ve problay got comments on this before but in case not, the lamp base is slightly askew and the cord loops up instead of hanging down.   I DO LOVE how you flipped the end of your hair so it looks like it''s hanging down in the air, Over all you paid a Lot of attention to detail, and I just really Like this!!', '2011-05-11 10:47:58.000000', NULL, 1),
