(6410640, 950701, 125275, '<td valign="top">very interestingly done</td>', 'very interestingly done', '2011-05-11 11:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6410646, 949900, 125275, '<td valign="top">I really like this because it conveys the duality I always feel when staying in a hotel. both the visibility from the outside, i.e. feeling like people can see you; as well as the feeling of looking out and wanting to be a part of the night and the city. It''s almost a feeling of being halfway in and halfway out, floating over the city while never leaving the room. This captures the dreamy, in-between emotion of transience and movement.</td>', 'I really like this because it conveys the duality I always feel when staying in a hotel. both the visibility from the outside, i.e. feeling like people can see you; as well as the feeling of looking out and wanting to be a part of the night and the city. It''s almost a feeling of being halfway in and halfway out, floating over the city while never leaving the room. This captures the dreamy, in-between emotion of transience and movement.', '2011-05-11 12:03:10.000000', NULL, 1),
