(6410759, 950044, 132251, '<td valign="top">I really like your idea here, but at a closer look I feel it would have been better if you more carefully hid the objects propping up the step and the lamp.</td>', 'I really like your idea here, but at a closer look I feel it would have been better if you more carefully hid the objects propping up the step and the lamp.', '2011-05-11 13:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6410772, 950920, 129091, '<td valign="top">This image really creates tension!  I see that you have without a doubt chosen a different perspective.  When I open the image the tree hits me smack in my face, and part of me wants to move it.  Then there is a part of me that feels like I''m hiding behind the tree.  Pretty good thinking.</td>', 'This image really creates tension!  I see that you have without a doubt chosen a different perspective.  When I open the image the tree hits me smack in my face, and part of me wants to move it.  Then there is a part of me that feels like I''m hiding behind the tree.  Pretty good thinking.', '2011-05-11 13:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
