(6411045, 950980, 11769, '<td valign="top">Just love how everyone down there has their own shadow. Remarkable shot of vertigo. And as an added bonus there is a Burger King across the street.</td>', 'Just love how everyone down there has their own shadow. Remarkable shot of vertigo. And as an added bonus there is a Burger King across the street.', '2011-05-11 16:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
