(6411605, 950742, 11467, '<td valign="top">Hehe, this is cool. Fits the challenge perfectly.<br/>I like how you have rotated the image. I think it is somehow missing a bit of pop though. Is this using the on camera flash? the lighting looks a bit flat. Using a reflector or off camera flash might have fixed this.</td>', 'Hehe, this is cool. Fits the challenge perfectly.I like how you have rotated the image. I think it is somehow missing a bit of pop though. Is this using the on camera flash? the lighting looks a bit flat. Using a reflector or off camera flash might have fixed this.', '2011-05-12 04:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
