(6411639, 950550, 11467, '<td valign="top">This is excellent.<br/>Not a particularly good photo technically speaking (sky is over exposed and only white, feet are cropped off) but it is funny and fits the challenge well. 7</td>', 'This is excellent.Not a particularly good photo technically speaking (sky is over exposed and only white, feet are cropped off) but it is funny and fits the challenge well. 7', '2011-05-12 07:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6411640, 950044, 11467, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea and quite well done.<br/>what lets it down is the wrinkles in the wall, and the use of on camera flash. Also the feet being cropped off, and table on the left being cropped. Fore some reason I always though t it was an ironing board.<br/>Using a light source that simulates a window or ceiling light would have been better. However you get extra points for the obvious thought and work you put into the image. 7</td>', 'Excellent idea and quite well done.what lets it down is the wrinkles in the wall, and the use of on camera flash. Also the feet being cropped off, and table on the left being cropped. Fore some reason I always though t it was an ironing board.Using a light source that simulates a window or ceiling light would have been better. However you get extra points for the obvious thought and work you put into the image. 7', '2011-05-12 07:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
