(6412512, 950436, 10785, '<td valign="top">This is not a very good point of view. A more classic point of view would be to be looking up at the excavator from the bucket at the front giving it those distorted proportions. Also, the photo is somewhat out of focus and the stars are not very sharp.</td>', 'This is not a very good point of view. A more classic point of view would be to be looking up at the excavator from the bucket at the front giving it those distorted proportions. Also, the photo is somewhat out of focus and the stars are not very sharp.', '2011-05-13 09:27:19.000000', NULL, 1),
