(6412856, 950799, 117474, '<td valign="top">I quite liked this. It was interesting and brought thoughts of looking out of a gun barrel to mind when I saw it. I did think that the blacks were cut off a little (only a personal preference though) and I did think a tighter crop from the left would have benefitted the image (personal preference again). <br/> <br/>However, think of the challenge--point of view. This is one of the best captures of a unique and interesting point of view so well done on that! I''d say you''ll get a PB for this without too much trouble. I gave this a 6.</td>', 'I quite liked this. It was interesting and brought thoughts of looking out of a gun barrel to mind when I saw it. I did think that the blacks were cut off a little (only a personal preference though) and I did think a tighter crop from the left would have benefitted the image (personal preference again).  However, think of the challenge--point of view. This is one of the best captures of a unique and interesting point of view so well done on that! I''d say you''ll get a PB for this without too much trouble. I gave this a 6.', '2011-05-13 14:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
