(6413742, 950911, 108069, '<td valign="top">Well this is how it was scripted. It''s what I had in mind and it''s what you''ve done, but much, much better. Excellent image.</td>', 'Well this is how it was scripted. It''s what I had in mind and it''s what you''ve done, but much, much better. Excellent image.', '2011-05-14 22:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6413743, 950902, 108069, '<td valign="top">This just made me smile as wide as I ever have. Lovely stuff.</td>', 'This just made me smile as wide as I ever have. Lovely stuff.', '2011-05-14 22:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6413746, 950092, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great shot. I find it extremely difficult to capture photos like this. You''d think it''d be easy. Lens capable of shallow DoF, leaf, rain drops. Simple enough, but I cannot get it right. This is right. In advanced I''d love to see it with a minor vignette and darker to give it some mood. But that''s me, and under different editing rules. Well done.</td>', 'Great shot. I find it extremely difficult to capture photos like this. You''d think it''d be easy. Lens capable of shallow DoF, leaf, rain drops. Simple enough, but I cannot get it right. This is right. In advanced I''d love to see it with a minor vignette and darker to give it some mood. But that''s me, and under different editing rules. Well done.', '2011-05-14 22:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6413748, 951010, 108069, '<td valign="top">I really like this. Wonderful depth.</td>', 'I really like this. Wonderful depth.', '2011-05-14 22:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6413755, 950953, 111808, '<td valign="top">I love this - the colours are so vibrant and it has been taken in such a way that the horse, while stationery, seems very powerful. Magnificent Beast chasing circles. Beautiful photograph.</td>', 'I love this - the colours are so vibrant and it has been taken in such a way that the horse, while stationery, seems very powerful. Magnificent Beast chasing circles. Beautiful photograph.', '2011-05-14 22:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6413829, 949803, 94815, '<td valign="top">My highest in the challenge, something''s fishy here...? This shot has it all - composition and an abstract sense of what is (or is not) real. The veil between us and the monster seems inadequate to the task but the power of the mind makes it all work. I like the monster alarm bell too. What a hoot!</td>', 'My highest in the challenge, something''s fishy here...? This shot has it all - composition and an abstract sense of what is (or is not) real. The veil between us and the monster seems inadequate to the task but the power of the mind makes it all work. I like the monster alarm bell too. What a hoot!', '2011-05-15 01:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
