(6416565, 950208, 71657, '<td valign="top">Ok Richard, I commented on it because I knew it was yours because why...you emailed it to me? You send me a pm I didn''t get telling me which one was yours?   Get over it man.  I made comments on many pics this challenge.  And if you are ignoring me, why do you keep bringing it up?  As for my comment, it may be a unique feature, but it is not a unique point of view in my opinion.  Sorry you don''t like my way of seeing it.  Had you been taking off in a helicopter and catch this at the right angle, THAT would be a unique point of view.  Nice clean photo, though.  Regardless, I gave you a 5, right in the middle for nice and clean photo.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-05-18 02:24:32.</i></td>', 'Ok Richard, I commented on it because I knew it was yours because why...you emailed it to me? You send me a pm I didn''t get telling me which one was yours?   Get over it man.  I made comments on many pics this challenge.  And if you are ignoring me, why do you keep bringing it up?  As for my comment, it may be a unique feature, but it is not a unique point of view in my opinion.  Sorry you don''t like my way of seeing it.  Had you been taking off in a helicopter and catch this at the right angle, THAT would be a unique point of view.  Nice clean photo, though.  Regardless, I gave you a 5, right in the middle for nice and clean photo.', '2011-05-18 03:22:25.000000', '2011-05-18 03:24:32.000000', 0),
