(6418053, 950986, 39057, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe someone actually took the time to report a possible rules violation on this image. I remember teaching you how to do zoom blur a few months ago. As far as you doing this in Photoshop....Harr harrr harr....you don''t even know how to make a new layer !!!<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by rugman1969:</b></div><hr/><i> To whoever requested a proof of original...It meets challenge rules.  I did not photoshop it to make it look this way!  Thanks for the encouragement, though...(other thoughts not worth repeating).  For the rest, thank you for posting comments and voting.  Many may not like me, but I ALWAYS follow the rules. </i></td></tr></table><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-05-19 11:05:00.</i></td>', 'I can''t believe someone actually took the time to report a possible rules violation on this image. I remember teaching you how to do zoom blur a few months ago. As far as you doing this in Photoshop....Harr harrr harr....you don''t even know how to make a new layer !!! Originally posted by rugman1969: To whoever requested a proof of original...It meets challenge rules.  I did not photoshop it to make it look this way!  Thanks for the encouragement, though...(other thoughts not worth repeating).  For the rest, thank you for posting comments and voting.  Many may not like me, but I ALWAYS follow the rules. ', '2011-05-19 00:50:49.000000', '2011-05-19 12:05:00.000000', 0),
