(6422418, 950951, 100831, '<td valign="top">it was an eight from me - I just read your notes too.... isn''t it amazing how sometimes we just get an idea, take a quick shot and it turns out so well! And then other times... well I won''t get it into that :). But I seriously don''t think you could have planned this better.<br/>Congrats on the high placement!!!</td>', 'it was an eight from me - I just read your notes too.... isn''t it amazing how sometimes we just get an idea, take a quick shot and it turns out so well! And then other times... well I won''t get it into that :). But I seriously don''t think you could have planned this better.Congrats on the high placement!!!', '2011-05-23 13:35:47.000000', NULL, 0),
